OL,3,GNEWSAITV investigating soap actor after
OL,4,Abar incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreater Manchester Police said officers
OL,7,Fattended a bar in Watson Street at
OL,8,Fabout 02:30 GMT following reports of a
OL,9,Fdisturbance. No arrests have been made.
OL,10,FAn ITV spokesperson said they were
OL,11,Finvestigating and would be speaking
OL,12,Fwith Roberts.
